"""
SMS warehouse builder - v2 (performance + correctness fixes)
CHANGES vs previous version
-----------------------------
1. 01b_broker_association_events: post-processing guarantees every
   (client_id, broker_name) pair found ANYWHERE across all 16 tables
   appears in the first table.  Missing pairs get latest_status =
   "inferred_from_activity".
2. NSE_UCC_WELCOME no longer creates a broker association row when
   broker_name cannot be determined (UCC ≠ broker).
3. 02_transactions_combined now includes:
     - instrument_type column (ETF / EQ)
     - credit transactions (NSDL/CDSL share credits)
     - payout/withdrawal rows (merged from old table 07)
4. Fund-balance capture fix: norm_fields aliases updated so
   BSE_FUND_BALANCE_EOD values reach the output.
5. Payout detection broadened: generic patterns added for Zerodha,
   Groww, MOFSL and other brokers.
6. 08_mutual_fund_activity: better SIP vs lumpsum differentiation
   using SMS body heuristics.
7. NSDL CREDIT_GENERAL rule added to capture share credits.
"""
